        "description": "Prior work has shown that shifted contact derived Artin stacks admit smooth Darboux atlases. However, establishing enumerative invariants and linearizing these categorical structures requires equivariant local models. We establish an equivariant Darboux theorem for $-1$-shifted contact derived Artin",
